{
  "_meta": {
    "class": "DIRECTNESS",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "直白度标记，用于反向模式（R 轨）计算 Abrasion 得罪风险。与 hedges.json 互为反面：hedges 多则直白度低。",
    "note": "正向模式不使用本词典。见 reference/03-friction-scoring.md §7。",
    "fields": {
      "weight": "0-1，对 directness_index 的贡献权重",
      "kind": "negation=直接否定 | ultimatum=最后通牒 | imperative=命令 | demand=硬性要求 | dismissal=终止"
    }
  },
